WEBVTT

00:00:00.118 --> 00:00:08.950
This video shows how to record other income on your phone. Use it for money that is not fees, such as sales and donations.

00:00:10.620 --> 00:00:20.388
Tap the menu button at the top left, open Finance, and choose Other Income. The page shows the income recorded for the selected month and year.

00:00:21.191 --> 00:00:27.671
Tap Add Income at the top of the page. A form titled Add Other Income opens.

00:00:28.660 --> 00:00:37.684
Enter the amount, here 2500. Choose the category, Donations, and the account that receives the money, Main Cash.

00:00:38.152 --> 00:00:44.776
Type a short description, here Annual day donation. The date is today by default.

00:00:47.383 --> 00:00:56.047
Tap Add Income to save. A message says the income was recorded, and the entry appears in the list with the total at the top.

00:00:59.372 --> 00:01:04.340
The income is recorded. It now counts in the month's total.
